OL,3,GNEWSAScotland glows as Weather Watchers
OL,4,Acatch beautiful sunrises
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chilly start to the morning caused by
OL,7,Fclear skies overnight led to the BBC
OL,8,FWeather Watchers sending in photos of
OL,9,Fgleaming sunrises across Scotland.
OL,11,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Scotland
OL,12,FBreakfast, weather presenter Joy Dunlop
OL,13,Fsaid the clear skies had led to some
OL,14,F"beautiful pictures coming in from our
OL,15,FWeather Watchers".
OL,17,FShe went on to say that sunny and dry
OL,18,Fconditions may start worsen as wind and
OL,19,Frain move in. So, here is a selection
OL,20,Fof today's sunrise pictures to enjoy in
OL,21,Fthe meantime.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
